+//     chunks; the data spans the record's pname field (20 bytes) +
+//     v0..v6 (28) + w0..w2 (12) -- pname is DATA here, not a string,
+//     so it is not NUL-terminated below -- and w3 packs the chunk
+//     index (bits 0-7) | the byte count (bits 8-15) | idx (bits 16-23)
+//     | slot (bits 24-31). One greppable log line per chunk.
